  "body": "Substantial in scale and superbly positioned, this impressive four-bedroom residence has been extensively renovated to create a sophisticated yet wonderfully welcoming family haven. Offering an exceptional blend of style, space and an enviable St Heliers lifestyle. \r\n\r\nBathed in an abundance of sun and natural light, the home showcases beautifully appointed interiors with a timeless neutral palette and quality finishes throughout. Designed with modern family living firmly in mind, the generous layout provides multiple living options with exceptional flexibility for relaxing, entertaining or working from home. \r\n\r\n At the heart of the home will no doubt be the open plan bespoke kitchen, dining and casual living space, which flows beautifully through large bi-folds onto sunny north facing timber deck. \r\n\r\n Offering four generous bedrooms, two bathrooms plus a powder room, there is plenty of room for families to spread out and enjoy. Multiple separate living areas provide excellent flexibility for relaxed family living, entertaining guests or creating dedicated spaces for children and adults. \r\n\r\nThe superb indoor/outdoor flow is a standout feature, with multiple outdoor entertaining areas providing the perfect setting for summer gatherings, alfresco dining or simply enjoying the sunshine throughout the day. A well-designed laundry and excellent storage throughout add to the home's practicality, while generous off-street parking provides further convenience. \r\n\r\n Perfectly appointed in one of St Heliers highly sought after location, and just a five-minute stroll from St Heliers Village, the beach and local parks, placing everything you need for an easy, connected lifestyle close at hand.",
